    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327030/extras/d4d52836bb30af3d3664efa2244aa54a.avif?t=1741760359\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This is a work in progress and not a final product.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling adventure as you descend through the dark levels of a mysterious bunker. Each level is connected by an elevator that takes you deeper, but it won't be easy. You'll have to solve challenging puzzles and face intriguing obstacles to move forward. Your decisions shape the storyline, adding layers of suspense and tension at every turn. Combining elements of adventure and escape rooms, <i>Bunker Descent</i> keeps you on the edge of your seat with unexpected twists and a few scares. Ready to take the plunge?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This is a work in progress and not a final product.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling adventure as you descend through the dark levels of a mysterious bunker. Each level is connected by an elevator that takes you deeper, but it won't be easy. You'll have to solve challenging puzzles and face intriguing obstacles to move forward. Your decisions shape the storyline, adding layers of suspense and tension at every turn. Combining elements of adventure and escape rooms, <i>Bunker Descent</i> keeps you on the edge of your seat with unexpected twists and a few scares. Ready to take the plunge?</p>",
    "short_description": "Work your way down through the bunker levels, solving puzzles and tackling challenges. Your choices drive the story\u2019s twists and turns, shaping the intrigue and suspense along the way.",
